// Create a btrbak snapshot before packages are installed or upgraded.
//
// Runs the `apt` group from /etc/btrbak/groups.yaml via
// /usr/lib/btrbak/btrbak-apt-pre.  The group is empty by default, so this is
// a no-op until members are added there.
//
// The hook is invoked WITHOUT `|| true`: it exits 0 when it intentionally
// skips (a fresh snapshot marker from an earlier dpkg run in this same
// transaction), so the normal no-op case never blocks apt. A genuine snapshot
// failure exits non-zero and aborts the transaction, which is the intended
// visible-failure policy.

DPkg::Pre-Invoke { "/usr/lib/btrbak/btrbak-apt-pre"; };
